          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{x}&\\geq 0\\\\2\\sqrt{x}&\\geq 0.\\end{align*}$$\nThe minimum value is $0$, attained at $x=0$, and there is no upper bound. The range is $y\\geq 0$.",
